      "writtenOn": "2020-04-20T14:44:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Correct, just direct deps mostly for two reasons:\n1. It covers AndroidApps (or any extension of java module, e.g. test rules).\n2. Avoids tech debt in build system. Each transitive dep being checked dozen of times (or even hundreds once we do this for tests) is unnecessary work that adds time to build. Avoids \"death by thousand cuts\" scenario.\n\nHow close is that CL to being submitted? I\u0027d rather submitted Java as well, so I can focus on other stuff and prevent any regressions. ShouldSupportSdkVersion is equivalent to CheckStableSdkVersion introduced here (WIP).",
      "parentUuid": "7ffb4f71_e729c694",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1940,
        "startChar": 17,
        "endLine": 1940,
        "endChar": 21
      },
      "revId": "9981b35369ed63336cfad41628b9b5e18864fff2",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "5888e815_a7b95606",
        "filename": "apex/apex.go",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 1940,
      "author": {
        "id": 1132673
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-04-20T15:07:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "One drawback of doing the check only for direct dep is you loose context unless the context is passed down via a top-down mutator.\n\nFor example, we might not want to check these for the java modules that are included in a non-updatable apex or a test apex. But you can\u0027t prune that out because each java module doesn\u0027t know whether it is built for which apex.\n\nAlso, checking the direct deps is bad for readability IMO. The same check routine is spread across here and the java package.",
      "parentUuid": "2669c35c_eb54ebcd",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1940,
        "startChar": 17,
        "endLine": 1940,
        "endChar": 21
      },
      "revId": "9981b35369ed63336cfad41628b9b5e18864fff2",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "ca2777cd_1977ebdd",
